                           &lt;li&gt;=0A                                         =
                           &lt;p&gt;In the next step, tap the Window key + R.&lt;/p&gt;=
=0A                                                                &lt;/li&gt;=0A=
                                                                &lt;li&gt;=0A    =
                                                                &lt;p&gt;Next, th=
e Run dialogue box will open.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                                       =
                         &lt;/li&gt;=0A                                          =
                      &lt;li&gt;=0A                                              =
                      &lt;p&gt;Now, enter =E2=80=9Ccontrol/name Microsoft.Devices=
AndPrinters.=E2=80=9D=0A                                                   =
                 &lt;/p&gt;=0A                                                   =
             &lt;/li&gt;=0A                                                      =
          &lt;li&gt;=0A                                                          =
